10 ON ERROR GOTO 900
20 TRY
30 PRINT "TRY BEFORE"
40 GOSUB 500
50 PRINT "TRY AFTER"
60 ERROR 42
70 CATCH ex AS ERR
80 PRINT "CATCH BEFORE"
90 GOSUB 600
100 PRINT "CATCH AFTER"
110 END TRY
120 PRINT "DONE"
130 END
500 PRINT "TRY ROUTINE"
510 RETURN
